option.SSGI.comment=Limited diffuse screen-space approximation. Not path tracing.
option.SSR.comment=Visible geometry only. Off-screen rays use an analytic sky fallback.
option.PBR.comment=Partial labPBR decoding; no parallax occlusion mapping.
option.TAA.comment=Camera reprojection and history clipping; check moving objects for ghosting.
option.DOF.comment=Focus follows the center of the image. Enabled in Cinematic Extreme.
option.MOTION_BLUR.comment=Camera motion only; no per-object velocity buffer. Disabled by default.
option.SATURATION.comment=Default 0.9 for more restrained colors. 1.0 gives full saturation.
option.CONTRAST.comment=Default 0.95 for softer shadows and highlights. Black stays black.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Default 0.08 for a subtle glow.
option.SHARPENING.comment=Default 0.08 reduces harsh edges and sharpening halos.
